#: main.ts:180
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染。"

#: main.ts:181
msgid "AI upscaling starts when GPU rendering is ready."
msgstr "GPU 渲染就绪后，AI 超分辨率即会生效。"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:185
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering, which cannot be turned on here: {}"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染，但本机无法开启 GPU 渲染：{}"

#: main.ts:189
msgid "GPU rendering stopped during this run: restart the player to use AI upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染在本次运行中已停止：请重启播放器以使用 AI 超分辨率。"

#: main.ts:190
msgid "GPU rendering is on from the next start: restart the player to use AI upscaling."
msgstr "GPU 渲染将在下次启动时开启：请重启播放器以使用 AI 超分辨率。"

#: main.ts:191
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering: turn on Video ▸ GPU Rendering (Experimental), then restart the player."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染：请打开“视频 ▸ GPU 渲染（实验性）”，然后重启播放器。"

#. {} is one or more plugin names, as their manifests give them.
#: main.ts:207
msgid "AI upscaling waits: the video filters of {} need the frames in memory, so the video is not decoded on the GPU. Turn those filters off or reset them there; upscaling then starts by itself."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待中：{} 的视频滤镜需要把画面放在内存中，因此视频没有在显卡上解码。请在对应插件中关闭或复位这些滤镜，之后超分辨率会自动开始。"

#: main.ts:211
msgid "AI upscaling waits: hardware decoding copies the frames back to memory (copy-back), as the player's hardware decoding setting asks. Upscaling needs the video decoded on the GPU without copy-back."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待中：按播放器的硬件解码设置，解码后的画面会复制回内存（copy-back）。超分辨率需要在显卡上直接解码，不经 copy-back。"

#: main.ts:215
msgid "AI upscaling waits: hardware decoding is off. Upscaling needs the video decoded on the GPU."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待中：硬件解码已关闭。超分辨率需要视频在显卡上解码。"

#: main.ts:218
msgid "AI upscaling waits: this video is decoded in software, for example a cover picture or a format the GPU cannot decode. It starts again with a video the GPU decodes."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待中：此视频为软件解码，例如封面图片，或显卡无法解码的格式。播放显卡能解码的视频时会重新开始。"

#: main.ts:221
msgid "AI upscaling waits: this video is decoded with another hardware decoder than the one upscaling needs."
msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待中：此视频使用的硬件解码器不是超分辨率所需的那一个。"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:225
msgid "AI upscaling waits: {}"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待中：{}"

#: main.ts:235
msgid "AI Upscaling: On, waits until other video filters are off"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开，其他视频滤镜关闭后生效"

#: main.ts:237
msgid "AI Upscaling: On, waits until hardware decoding is on"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开，硬件解码打开后生效"

#: main.ts:239
msgid "AI Upscaling: On, waits: this video is decoded in software"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开，此视频为软件解码，暂不生效"

#: main.ts:241
msgid "AI Upscaling: On, waits: the video uses another hardware decoder"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开，此视频用了其他硬件解码器，暂不生效"

#: main.ts:243
msgid "AI Upscaling: On, waits until the video is decoded on the GPU"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率：开，视频在显卡上解码后生效"

#. the first {} is our advice, the second the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:257
msgid "{} ({})"
msgstr "{}（{}）"

#: main.ts:262
msgid "AI upscaling is not available on this system. It needs Windows and an NVIDIA RTX GPU."
msgstr "本机无法使用 AI 超分辨率，需要 Windows 和 NVIDIA RTX 显卡。"

#: main.ts:264
msgid "AI upscaling is not available on this computer. It needs an NVIDIA RTX GPU."
msgstr "本机无法使用 AI 超分辨率，需要 NVIDIA RTX 显卡。"

#: main.ts:270
msgid "The player runs on a GPU that cannot upscale: in Windows Settings ▸ System ▸ Display ▸ Graphics, choose the high-performance GPU for Vestra Player, then restart it."
msgstr "播放器正运行在不支持超分辨率的显卡上：请在 Windows 设置 ▸ 系统 ▸ 屏幕 ▸ 显示卡 中为 Vestra Player 选择“高性能”显卡，然后重启播放器。"

#: main.ts:274
msgid "The NVIDIA driver is too old for AI upscaling: update it to version 530 or newer."
msgstr "NVIDIA 驱动版本过旧，无法使用 AI 超分辨率：请更新到 530 或更高版本。"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:281
msgid "AI upscaling is not available on this computer: {}"
msgstr "本机无法使用 AI 超分辨率：{}"

