msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待中：此视频为软件解码"

#: main.ts:312
msgid "AI upscaling waits: the video uses another hardware decoder"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待中：此视频用了其他硬件解码器"

#: main.ts:314
msgid "AI upscaling waits until the video is decoded on the GPU"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率等待视频在显卡上解码"

#: main.ts:318
msgid "AI upscaling needs GPU rendering"
msgstr "AI 超分辨率需要 GPU 渲染"

#: main.ts:319
