#: manifest.json
msgid "VestraUpscale"
msgstr "VestraUpscale"

#: manifest.json
msgid "AI upscaling of the video with NVIDIA RTX Video Super Resolution"
msgstr "用 NVIDIA RTX 视频超分辨率对视频做 AI 放大"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Adds Video ▸ AI Upscaling (RTX Video Super Resolution): the NVIDIA GPU sharpens and enlarges the video to the size it is shown at. Video ▸ AI Upscaling… opens a window that turns it on and off and shows how it runs: the sizes and scale factor, the GPU, the decoding, and which plugins' video filters hold it back. Needs Windows, an NVIDIA RTX GPU, GPU rendering and Super Resolution turned on in the NVIDIA app. On macOS and Linux the item is greyed out from the start; on Windows it is greyed out with the reason once the player has checked the GPU. Remembers your choice."
msgstr "添加“视频 ▸ AI 超分辨率（RTX 视频超分辨率）”：由 NVIDIA 显卡将视频锐化并放大到显示尺寸。“视频 ▸ AI 超分辨率…”打开一个窗口，可一键开关，并显示运行情况：尺寸与放大倍数、显卡、解码方式，以及哪些插件的视频滤镜在阻碍它。需要 Windows、NVIDIA RTX 显卡、GPU 渲染，并在 NVIDIA App 中打开“超分辨率”。在 macOS 和 Linux 上该菜单项一开始就是灰色；在 Windows 上，播放器检查显卡后如无法使用，菜单项变灰并显示原因。会记住你的选择。"

